1. All component functions should be arrow functions
2. All functions should start with capital names
3. all variables should start with lower case
4. constants should be Capital letters

How To start a Venv
Create the virtual environment
python -m venv venv
Activate the virtual environment
.\venv\Scripts\Activate
ON MAC
source ./venv/bin/activate

run backend
uvicorn app.main:app --reload
to run backend dev python app.py

pull remote branch to local machine
git fetch origin <branch-name>
git fetch origin

merge random branch with main
git merge origin/main

THIS COMMAND IS USED FOR CHANGING DEV FROM 127.0 ... to localhost
uvicorn app.main:app --reload --host localhost --port 8000
